(`slides/manuscript/main.tex:527–532`):

> Each model is queried five times at temperature zero, yielding
> \ExpOneNRuns{} runs against a \NumRefPlants-plant reference inventory of
> Vietnamese thermal power plants (coal and gas, all lifecycle statuses).
> Runs are evaluated by matching extracted plant names against the
