   matching … cell level for matched rows") restates scoring that belongs
   to §3 (the quality-dimensions framework, `sec:quality`). Replace it
   with e.g.: "Each run is then scored on the quality dimensions of
   §\ref{sec:quality}." — a ref, not a restated method.
   - The matcher mechanics (fuzzy matching, cell-level detail) live in the
     annex (coordinate with [[0602]]'s Scoring Annex A and the
     standalone-text policy [[0606]]); ensure the detail is present there.
3. Keep "Cost in USD and wall-clock time are recorded per run." (resource
   recording, not scoring detail) — unless the author folds it elsewhere.

